        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Muise, David Yerushalmi, Tom Monaghan\n- Organizations: American Freedom Law Center, Thomas More Law Center\n- Places: Ann Arbor, Michigan, United States\n- Roles: Senior Trial Counsel, co-founder, senior counsel\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Monaghan founded the Thomas More Law Center.\n- The Thomas More Law Center is a Christian, conservative, nonprofit public interest law firm based in Ann Arbor, Michigan, and active throughout the United States.\n- Before launching the American Freedom Law Center, Robert Muise was Senior Trial Counsel at the Thomas More Law Center in Ann Arbor.\n- David Yerushalmi and Robert Muise are co-founders of the American Freedom Law Center, and David Yerushalmi is its senior counsel.",
